physics (for resistance heat vs. combustion) points the other way in many circumstances. If you're curious, the strongest single question to ask her is: **"Did you get heat pumps, or just electric baseboard/resistance heaters?"** That answer alone would tell you a lot about whether her case generalizes or is more of a special situation.
