mmon sense that "electric feels like the modern, smart choice" is registering something true about the direction things are heading, especially with heat pumps. I'm not trying to talk you out of that instinct wholesale — I'm just trying to make sure the specific mechanical claim (resistance heaters = automatically cheaper) matches the actual numbers, which you can confirm yourself rather than taking anyone's word for, mine included.
